{
  "case_id": "2022-21-984",
  "document_hash": "867b8717e71a423b8175fa7667dd9be2b67ec2f5415761f962d1c343f0ec788e",
  "records": [
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2022-21-984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "867b8717e71a423b8175fa7667dd9be2b67ec2f5415761f962d1c343f0ec788e",
      "evidence_id": "ev-867b8717e71a-0000-0000",
      "kind": "fact",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 2,
        "start": 2
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "From 2014 to 2017, Hewitt worked for Helix on an offshore oil rig, typically working 84 hours a week while on the vessel. Helix paid Hewitt on a daily-rate basis, with no overtime compensation."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Helix Energy Solutions Group",
      "case_id": "2022-21-984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "867b8717e71a423b8175fa7667dd9be2b67ec2f5415761f962d1c343f0ec788e",
      "evidence_id": "ev-867b8717e71a-0000-0001",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 2,
        "start": 2
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Helix asserts that Hewitt was exempt from the FLSA because he qualifed as \u201ca bona fde executive.\u201d"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Fifth Circuit",
      "case_id": "2022-21-984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "867b8717e71a423b8175fa7667dd9be2b67ec2f5415761f962d1c343f0ec788e",
      "evidence_id": "ev-867b8717e71a-0000-0002",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 3,
        "start": 3
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "the Fifth Circuit reversed, deciding that Hewitt was not paid on a salary basis and therefore could claim the FLSA's protections."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2022-21-984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "867b8717e71a423b8175fa7667dd9be2b67ec2f5415761f962d1c343f0ec788e",
      "evidence_id": "ev-867b8717e71a-0001-0000",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": "majority",
      "pages": {
        "end": 11,
        "start": 11
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "We granted certiorari, 596 U. S. \u2013\u2013\u2013 (2022), and now affrm."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Hewitt",
      "case_id": "2022-21-984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "867b8717e71a423b8175fa7667dd9be2b67ec2f5415761f962d1c343f0ec788e",
      "evidence_id": "ev-867b8717e71a-0001-0003",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": "majority",
      "pages": {
        "end": 12,
        "start": 12
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "In denying executive status, Hewitt puts all his chips on that standard's frst part: He argues only that he was not paid on a salary basis."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2022-21-984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "867b8717e71a423b8175fa7667dd9be2b67ec2f5415761f962d1c343f0ec788e",
      "evidence_id": "ev-867b8717e71a-0001-0001",
      "kind": "holding",
      "opinion_part": "majority",
      "pages": {
        "end": 13,
        "start": 13
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The answer is no: Helix did not pay Hewitt on a salary basis as defned in \u00a7 602(a)."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Helix Energy Solutions Group, Inc.",
      "case_id": "2022-21-984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "867b8717e71a423b8175fa7667dd9be2b67ec2f5415761f962d1c343f0ec788e",
      "evidence_id": "ev-867b8717e71a-0001-0002",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": "majority",
      "pages": {
        "end": 15,
        "start": 15
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Helix contends that the single word \u201creceives\u201d converts \u00a7 602(a)'s focus: In saying that an employee must \u201creceive[ ]\u201d a fxed amount on a weekly or less frequent basis, the provision mandates only that he get his paycheck no more often than once a week (which of course most employees do)."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2022-21-984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "867b8717e71a423b8175fa7667dd9be2b67ec2f5415761f962d1c343f0ec788e",
      "evidence_id": "ev-867b8717e71a-0002-0001",
      "kind": "holding",
      "opinion_part": "majority",
      "pages": {
        "end": 21,
        "start": 21
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The upshot is that \u00a7 604(b) applies, just as \u00a7 602(a) does, to the HCE and general rules alike."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Helix Energy Solutions Group, Inc.",
      "case_id": "2022-21-984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "867b8717e71a423b8175fa7667dd9be2b67ec2f5415761f962d1c343f0ec788e",
      "evidence_id": "ev-867b8717e71a-0002-0005",
      "kind": "stated_consequence",
      "opinion_part": "majority",
      "pages": {
        "end": 24,
        "start": 24
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "It is in fact Helix's position that would create disturbing consequences, by depriving even workers at the heartland of the FLSA's protection\u2014those paid less than $100,000 annually\u2014of overtime pay."
    }
  ],
  "schema_version": "1.0.0"
}
